description=예외 원문(getMessage)을 응답에 넣기 금지: 고정 ErrorCode 와 짝지어 넘기기, CustomException detail 에 붙이기 (원문은 로그·cause 로만)
paths=server/PQL-Application/src/main/java/,server/PQL-Common/src/main/java/,server/PQL-Domain-AI/src/main/java/,server/PQL-Domain-Member/src/main/java/,server/PQL-Domain-Meta/src/main/java/,server/PQL-Domain-Question/src/main/java/,server/PQL-Domain-Submission/src/main/java/,server/PQL-Web/src/main/java/
extensions=.java
pattern=(?:ErrorCode\.[A-Z_]+\s*,|new CustomException\()[^;]*?\b(?!errorCode\b)[a-z]\w*\.getMessage\(\)
